msgid ""
"Flips through all the windows present in the Switcher, in reverse order."
msgstr "በ መቀየሪያ ውስጥ ያሉትን ሁሉንም መስኮቶች መገልበጫ በ ተቃራኑ ደንብ"

#: ../plugins/unityshell/unityshell.xml.in.h:140
